Package: google-chrome-stable
Version: 157.0.8103.78-1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Provides: google-chrome
Description: The popular web browser by Google (Stable Channel, official arm64 build)
 Google Chrome is a fast, secure web browser. This package republishes Google's
 official arm64 Debian build unchanged, so its maintainer scripts (icons,
 AppArmor profile, update-alternatives and the Google APT repository/signing
 key setup) all keep working.
 .
 Hardware video decode is enabled automatically when the iris-vaapi package is
 installed, which wraps the browser with the required VA-API flags.
